</code></pre> ​插件​ ​作用​ <code>nativeBridge</code> ​替换​ Native Compose ​依赖​、​窗口​运行​时​与​分发​ <code>nativeBridgeSettings</code> Settings ​级​配套​，​通常​由​仓库​配置​ <p>JVM ​与​ Android ​目标​继续​使用​官方​ Compose；​桥​插件​只​影响​ Native target。</p>

nativeMain/Main.kt<pre><code>private val appReference = LazyReference&lt;DesktopApplication&gt;()

class DesktopApplication(
    override val commandArgs: Array&lt;String&gt;,
) : PlatformApplication&lt;DesktopApplication&gt;(appReference) {

    override val initPosition = WindowPosition.Aligned(Alignment.Center)
    override val initPlacement = WindowPlacement.Floating

    @Composable
    override fun Content() {
        // ​应用​内容​
    }
}

fun main(args: Array&lt;String&gt;) = DesktopApplication(args).run()
</code></pre> <p>Native ​入口​不​自动​读取​或​解析​进程​参数​，<code>commandArgs</code> ​由​入口​显式​传入​。</p>

DesktopAndroidWebiOSNative Desktop desktopMain/Main.kt<pre><code>class DesktopApplication : HelloApplication(PlatformContext.Instance) {
    override val title = "Hello Rachel"
}

fun main() {
    DesktopApplication().run()
}
</code></pre> androidMain<pre><code>class AndroidApplication : ComposeApplication() {
    override fun buildInstance() = HelloApplication(this)
}

class MainActivity : ComposeActivity()
</code></pre> <p>Manifest ​中​的​ application ​与​ activity ​应​指向​上述​类型​。Activity ​负责​ edge-to-edge、​启动​ Intent ​与​第二阶段​服务​初始化​。</p> webMain/Main.kt<pre><code>fun main() {
    HelloApplication(PlatformContext.Instance).run()
}
</code></pre> <p>JS ​与​ WasmJS ​共用​ Web ​实现​，​渲染​到​ <code>document.body</code>。​刷新​会​创建​新​的​应用​实例​，​跨​刷新​数据​应​交给​持久​化​服务​。</p> iosMain<pre><code>class IOSApplication : HelloApplication(PlatformContext.Instance)
</code></pre> <p>Swift ​宿主​持有​该​实例​，​先​调用​ <code>run()</code>，​再​通过​ <code>buildUIViewController()</code> ​获取​控制器​。​视图​加载​不​等于​已经​关联​窗口​，​需要​窗口​的​能力​应​处理​空值​。</p> nativeMain/Main.kt<pre><code>private val applicationReference = LazyReference&lt;NativeHelloApplication&gt;()

private class NativeHelloApplication(
    override val commandArgs: Array&lt;String&gt;
) : HelloApplication(applicationReference, PlatformContext.Instance) {
    override val title = "Hello Rachel"
}

fun main(args: Array&lt;String&gt;) = NativeHelloApplication(args).run()
</code></pre> <p>Native ​入口​不​依赖​ JVM，​需要​启用​桌面​ Native ​目标​并​安装​ Native Bridge ​插件​。​详见​ Native Compose。</p>

设备​状态​<pre><code>val device by rememberDevice()
val size by rememberDeviceSize()
val type by rememberDeviceType()
</code></pre> <p>​这些​函数​读取​ <code>LocalWindowInfo.current.containerDpSize</code> ​并​返回​派生​ <code>State</code>。<code>rememberDevice</code> ​使用​完整​宽高​，​不​采用​仅​宽度​构造​器​的​形态​推断​。</p> ​布局​分支​<pre><code>@Composable
fun AccountContent() {
    val device by rememberDevice()

    when (device.type) {
        Device.Type.PORTRAIT -&gt; AccountSingleColumn()
        Device.Type.SQUARE -&gt; AccountCompactLayout()
        Device.Type.LANDSCAPE -&gt; AccountWideLayout(
            showAside = device.size == Device.Size.LARGE,
        )
    }
}
</code></pre> <p>​窗口​容器​不是​嵌套​约束​</p> <p>​上述​分类​对应​窗口​容器​，​不​直接​反映​任意​嵌套​组件​的​局部​约束​。​局部​面板​需要​独立​响应​可用​空间​时​，​应​使用​其​布局​约束​计算​。</p>

Android ​源集​<pre><code>@Stable
data class NativeLabelParameters(
    val text: String,
    val onClick: () -&gt; Unit,
)

@Stable
class NativeLabelState : PlatformViewState&lt;TextView, NativeLabelParameters&gt;() {
    override fun factory(environment: PlatformViewEnvironment): TextView =
        TextView(environment.context)

    override fun attach(view: TextView) {
        view.setOnClickListener {
            onView(view) { parameters.onClick() }
        }
    }

    override fun synchronize(
        view: TextView,
        previous: NativeLabelParameters?,
        next: NativeLabelParameters,
    ) {
        if (previous?.text != next.text) view.text = next.text
    }

    override fun detach(view: TextView) {
        view.setOnClickListener(null)
    }
}

@Composable
fun NativeLabel(
    text: String,
    modifier: Modifier = Modifier,
    state: NativeLabelState = rememberPlatformViewState { NativeLabelState() },
    onClick: () -&gt; Unit = {},
) {
    PlatformViewHost(
        state = state,
        parameters = NativeLabelParameters(text, onClick),
        modifier = modifier,
    )
}
</code></pre> ​方法​ ​责任​ <code>factory(environment)</code> ​创建​一个​原生​视图​ <code>attach(view)</code> ​安装​监听​与​绑定​ <code>synchronize(view, previous, next)</code> ​按字段​同步​参数​ <code>detach(view)</code> ​释放​监听​、​任务​与​专属​资源​ <p>​普通​重组​不会​重新​创建​视图​。​参数​快照​应​采用​值​语义​；​首次​同步​时​ <code>previous</code> ​为​ null。​组件​实现​自行​比较​字​段​，​因此​回调​变化​不会​重新​执行​加载​网页​等​昂贵​操作​。</p> <p><code>onView(view)</code> ​将​事件​投递​到​ UI ​线程​，​并​检查​是否​仍​属于​同一个​活动​视图​。​已经​退场​的​旧​视图​不能​继续​更新​ state ​或​调用​外部​回调​。</p>

业务​页面​<pre><code>@Stable
class ScreenWebpage(url: String) : Screen() {
    private val state = WebViewState(url)

    override val title: String by derivedStateOf { state.title }

